        "Title": "The Dubai Deluge",
        "Location": "LOCATION_GOLDEN_GECKO",
        "PublicId": "127922613518",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/golden/mission_gecko/scene_gecko_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository fa0d8f9f-86a4-4977-9106-c8fd7a62bbf6).Image",
        "Description": "Hello, 47. A new contract has been issued on three employees of The Sceptre, the tallest building in Dubai. Eliminate Yaseera, Kalyan and Niraj, who have been directly linked to an international terrorist organization and are planning their next assassination. The power broker, Richard Chace, has also been seen checking in and we believe he is their leader. Drowning is preferable, since they&apos;re all afraid of water. You are cleared to engage. Assassinate the assassins. Good luck.",
